acceptance_criteria: Official tag SHAs and publication times are verified; three CodeQL subactions remain in lockstep; unchanged workflow contracts and static quality pass; new-head hosted security and exact full coverage pass; PR 1404 is linked to this canonical owner and closed as superseded only after the replacement lands
